# Customer mini-sites are rendered by the API (founder bug #12, 2026-08-25).
# namastepos.in/site/<slug> forwards to the server-rendered page so owners
# can share a first-party URL. 302 (not 200 proxy) because Cloudflare Pages
# can't rewrite cross-origin.
/site/* https://api.namastepos.in/site/:splat 302
